**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      TLC MONITOR SUBROUTINE                                        *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THIS SUBROUTINE TESTS THE EMR FOR OCCURRENCE OF A TLC,
*            EAM, OR EBM. IF ANY OF THESE BITS ARE DETECTED "ON", THE
*            MODULE, SECTOR, AND ADDRESS BITS OF THE CALLING ROUTINE
*            ARE INSERTED INTO AN ERROR MESSAGE. THIS ERROR MESSAGE IS
*            THEN TELEMETERED.

* ENTRIES    TLC      ENTERED EACH TIME CORE IS ACCESSED.

       ORG     INTP,D.DATA
TLCRT  BSS     1

TLC    STO     777
       CLA     777          SAVE HOP RETURN                           B
       STO     TLCRT

       PIO     023
       AND     =O7          HAS TLC, EAM, OR EBM OCCURRED             Q
       TNZ     *+2                                                    Y
       HOP     TLCRT                                                  N

       CLA     D.KB4        ISSUE TLC LIMITING BIT TO RESET INTERRUPT
       PIO     032

       CLA     CW           PICK UP ROLLOVER CW                       B
       SHR     3            SAVE MOD., SECT., ADD BITS                B
       AND     =O00000377
       STO     V.EMW
       CLA     CW
       SHR     9
       AND     =O000774
       XOR     V.EMW
       XOR     LVEM7        INSERT BITS INTO ERROR MESSAGE            B
       HOP     EMS          ERROR MONITOR                             P

       HOP     TLCRT        EXIT ON HOP RETURN                        X
